{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "The Lord of Pain — Decklist (Bracket 4)",
  "format": "commander",
  "description": "**Gameplan:** Rakdos group-slug with a poisoned-gift engine. Hand every opponent extra cards,\nextra mana and free spells (Howling Mine, Font of Mythos, Temple Bell, Seizan,\nDescent into Avernus) so that they draw more, cast more and\ncast bigger — then bill every one of those actions: each draw (Underworld Dreams, Fate\nUnraveler, Kederekt Parasite, Sheoldred, Razorkin Needlehead, Orcish Bowmasters,\nSpiteful Visions), each first spell of the turn (The Lord of Pain — you pick who eats\nthe damage), every spell (Kaervek, Painful Quandary), every upkeep (Mogis, Seizan), every\nland tapped (Manabarbs). Amplify it with opponent-only boosters (Solphim, Torbran, Torture\nPit, Twinflame Tyrant, Bloodletter, Wound Reflection) and keep yourself alive on Exquisite Blood /\nBloodthirsty Conqueror / Sheoldred while the commander stops them gaining anything back.\nClose with wheels into the draw-punishers, Torment of Hailfire / Exsanguinate / Gray Merchant,\nHeartless Hidetsugu under a doubler, or the Exquisite Blood + Sanguine Bond loop.\nYour own damage comes back as life: Basilisk Collar on the commander, Whip of Erebos on every\npinger, and Glacial Chasm prevents all damage dealt to you.",
